      "en": "Was anyone called having been circumcised? Let him not become uncircumcised. Has anyone been called in uncircumcision? Let him not be circumcised.",
      "ko": "할례자로 부르심을 받은 자가 있느냐 무할례자가 되지 말며 무할례자로 부르심을 받은 자가 있느냐 할례를 받지 말라",
      "source_text_hash": "b7b80b67945cb855815da21eca3e254761f77f8302d6fde2ae991992583aff74",
      "translation_text_hash": "fd2fb12396b5f1d50218441e120d263f7f54111e957b73a66a6573762f00ef76",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "할례자로 부르심을 받은 자가 있느냐 무할례자가 되지 말며 무할례자로 부르심을 받은 자가 있느냐 할례를 받지 말라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "fd2fb12396b5f1d50218441e120d263f7f54111e957b73a66a6573762f00ef76"
      ]
    },
