      "en": "Were you called being a bondservant? Don’t let that bother you, but if you get an opportunity to become free, use it.",
      "ko": "네가 종으로 있을 때에 부르심을 받았느냐 염려하지 말라 그러나 자유할 수 있거든 차라리 사용하라",
      "source_text_hash": "11246798e414af5882510cebcb53e1071b9976e1eb53c84c33e84b46ef220cf6",
      "translation_text_hash": "ca27d9aa46083727c97d18fae6d4ee258ba1ba9ff881258851173ca3b1c9e9e3",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
