      "en": "You were bought with a price. Don’t become bondservants of men.",
      "ko": "너희는 값으로 사신 것이니 사람들의 종이 되지 말라",
      "source_text_hash": "9d2316638e01f24ffc49c49d07dafbd7f2373478deee308dcede649a79f3b964",
