      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "1CO",
          "chapter": 7,
          "verse": 25
        }
      ],
      "en": "Now concerning virgins, I have no commandment from the Lord, but I give my judgment as one who has obtained mercy from the Lord to be trustworthy.",
      "ko": "처녀에 대하여는 내가 주께 받은 계명이 없으되 주의 자비하심을 받아서 충성된 자가 되어 의견을 고하노니",
      "source_text_hash": "55691b6144aee925d1c5b4b658c3d127763a16c178cb6d4560689f955e66924a",
      "translation_text_hash": "dc635f925e856cea11f0d17ffb27a64964b659282206edfd65b3c4feca8397fa",
