        {
          "book": "1CO",
          "chapter": 7,
          "verse": 33
        }
      ],
      "en": "but he who is married is concerned about the things of the world, how he may please his wife.",
      "ko": "장가 간 자는 세상 일을 염려하여 어찌하여야 아내를 기쁘게 할꼬 하여 마음이 나누이며",
      "source_text_hash": "0b248c775689d3f26b00716773a6a18e2c6239cbc533b5bff7058d7a8bd297f9",
